ds.com/en/news/magic-story/the-brothers-war-episode-3-sword-one","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-brothers-war-episode-3-sword-one","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Brothers' War | Episode 3: Sword One\" by Miguel Lopez. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Oct 2022."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Episode 2: Sand in the Hourglass","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Langley Hyde"],"date":"2022-08-11","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Episode 2: Sand in the Hourglass\" by Langley Hyde. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 11 Aug 2022."}]},"bio":[{"text":"In 2018 it is described as a place Needle infiltrated for the Cabal.","cites":["p:stories/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Return to Dominaria: Episode 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Martha Wells"],"date":"2018-03-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/return-dominaria-episode-1-2018-03-21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Return to Dominaria: Episode 1\" by Martha Wells. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Mar 2018."}]},{"text":"In 2022, Stenn meets Karn on a hill and tells him that King Darien tasked him with finding Phyrexian agents and that New Argive will mobilize.","cites":["episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11-e10"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-sand-hourglass-2022-08-11#:~:text=New%20Argive%20will%20mobilize."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coa